# data/ ignore rules (a template of the private repository, release/public/data/.gitignore).
#
# Real response exports never leave the machine: data/private/ is the
# documented drop location and is ignored wholesale, and every .tab/.csv
# anywhere under data/ is ignored by default. The working database is
# covered by the root rule `*.db`. The two caches are regenerable.
private/
question_sources/
question_previews/
**/*.tab
**/*.csv
